text: ['As Adaptive Automaton enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\nAdaptive Automaton is the chosen type in addition to its other types.\nOther creatures you control of the chosen type get +1/+1.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a creature card from your hand.\nDisaster Radius deals X damage to each creature your opponents control, where X is the revealed card's mana value.", 'Crumbling Necropolis enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}, {B}, or {R}.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\nWhen Jungle Barrier enters the battlefield, draw a card.", 'Destroy all creatures.', 'Destroy target creature or enchantment.', 'Destroy target nonblack creature.', "Double target player's life total. Shuffle Beacon of Immortality into its owner's library.", 'Draw three cards.', 'Each player sacrifices a creature.', "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has trample.\nWhen Rancor is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, return Rancor to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has first strike, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has flying, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2, has vigilance, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3, has trample, and can't attack you or planeswalkers you control.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature has indestructible.\nWhenever a creature enters the battlefield, you may attach Shielded by Faith to that creature.', 'Enchant creature with mana value 2 or less\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller may search their library for a basic land card, put that card onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Flying\nVampire Interloper can't block.", 'Flying\nWhenever a creature you control deals combat damage to a player, put that many +1/+1 counters on it.', 'Flying, deathtouch, lifelink', 'For each opponent, gain control of target permanent that player controls.', 'For each opponent, gain control of up to one target creature that player controls until end of turn. Untap those creatures. They gain haste until end of turn.', 'Jungle Shrine enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {R}, {G}, or {W}.', 'Lifelink', 'Lightning Helix deals 3 damage to any target and you gain 3 life.', "Other Merfolk creatures you control get +1/+1.\n{T}: Target Merfolk creature can't be blocked this turn.", "Return six target nonland permanents to their owners' hands.", "Return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Target creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn. Untap that creature.', 'Target creature gets +1/+2 and gains deathtouch until end of turn. (Any amount of damage it deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Target creature gets +2/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn. You may tap any number of untapped Vampire creatures you control. If you do, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those Vampires.', "Target creature you control fights target creature you don't control. (Each deals damage equal to its power to the other.)", 'Target player takes an extra turn after this one.', 'Trample\nWhenever another nontoken creature enters the battlefield under your control, you may draw a card.', 'Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and creatures your opponents control get -1/-1.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +3/+3 and gains trample and "Whenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, draw that many cards."', 'When Borderland Ranger enters the battlefield, you may search your library for a basic land card, reveal it, put it into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Whenever a creature you control attacks, it gets +1/+0 until end of turn for each other attacking creature that shares a creature type with it.', 'Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Bloodbond Vampire.', '{3}{R}{R}: Untap all creatures you control. After this main phase, there is an additional combat phase followed by an additional main phase. Activate only as a sorcery.', '{4}, {T}: You may put a creature card from your hand onto the battlefield.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{1}, {T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.']
